/****************************************************************************\
|* Framework for the PS2
|* =====================
|*
\****************************************************************************/

This is my attempt to put together some knowledge from around the net, from
various examples on the playstation2-linux site, and from personal conversation
into a useful framework to help develop programs for the PS2.

To make the framework, type 'make' in the top-level directory, or to make an
optimised library, type 'make opt'. In both cases, a test program will also
be made as 'main'.

Enjoy.

Simon.
